On September 22, WYPR reported: Luminis Health says it’s making considerable progress on restoring systems at two Maryland hospitals after they were hit by a cyberattack earlier this month. The company said in an online update that its telephone capabilities at Anne Arundel Medical Center and Doctors Community Medical Center in Lanham have been restored...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/09/24/two-maryland-hospitals-still-dealing-with-system-issues-after-cyberattack/">Source</a></p>

